-- title:
--   Values of integral functions at places where j is A-valued
-- statement:
--   Fix a valuation subring $A$ of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ and a nonzero natural number $M$. Let $F_M\subset\operatorname{LaurentSeries}\mathbb{Q}$ be the subfield generated over $\mathbb{Q}$ by the $q$-expansions $\mathrm{qExpand}\,\mathbb{Q}\,d\,(jq)$ for the nonzero divisors $d\mid M$, and let $L$ be `laurentBaseChange (AlgebraicClosure ℚ) (modularFunctionFieldFull M)`, the subfield of $\operatorname{LaurentSeries}\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ obtained by adjoining to $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ the image of $F_M$ under the coefficientwise embedding `coeffEmb`. Let $w$ be a place of $L$ over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$, i.e. a valuation subring of $L$ that contains the image of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$, is not all of $L$, and is a principal ideal ring; write $\operatorname{ord}_w$ for minus the logarithm of its associated adic valuation. Let $b\in L$, and assume $b$ is integral over the subring `affineBaseFin M A` generated by the image of $A$ in $L$ together with $\bar j$, the element of $L$ given by the image of the Laurent series $jq$ under `coeffEmb`: there is a monic polynomial over that subring vanishing at $b$. Assume further that for some $a_0\in A$ one has $0<\operatorname{ord}_w(\bar j-a_0)$. The conclusion is that there exists $a\in A$ such that $b-a$ lies in the set of nonunits of the valuation subring of $w$.
--
--   This is the standard propagation of $A$-rationality of values along integral extensions in the valuation theory of function fields: if the $j$-line coordinate takes a value in $A$ at the place $w$, then so does every function integral over $A[\bar j]$. It is used in the analysis of places of the fibre models of modular curves, for instance in the identification of the special places attached to cusp charts.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_exists_ord_sub_pos_of_integral_affineBaseFin.lean

import Definitions.Def_ModularCurve_FibreModel
import Definitions.Def_ModularCurve_ArithmeticGalois

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
